WEBVTT

1
00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:48.280
Jah, Veronika kuuleb.

2
00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:53.640
Hästi... Selge...

3
00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:57.080
Suur tänu!

4
00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:37.280
Tere!
Veronika räägib.

5
00:21:40.200 --> 00:21:41.520
Kas tõesti?

6
00:21:44.240 --> 00:21:45.960
Aitäh!

7
00:21:46.840 --> 00:21:48.760
Väga hea!

8
00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:57.160
Mida? Selge...

9
00:21:59.560 --> 00:22:02.520
Hästi... Head aega.
